    <Fragment slot="title"
      ><span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading"
        >Unveiling the Person Behind the Developer
      </span>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="subtitle">
      I enjoy solving problems, building smooth user experiences, and working with TypeScript and Java. I’m always
      learning, improving, and sharing what I discover along the way. This space is where I document my journey—the
      challenges, the achievements, and everything in between.
    </Fragment>
  </Hero>

